### 1. Получить все авто (200 OK)
GET https://wt-lab6-6minimalapi-borisevich.onrender.com/api/cars

### 2. Добавить новое авто (201 Created)
POST https://wt-lab6-6minimalapi-borisevich.onrender.com/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Ford",
  "model": "Focus",
  "year": 2021,
  "pricePerDay": 60,
  "isAvailable": true
}

### 3. Изменить авто (200 OK)
PUT https://wt-lab6-6minimalapi-borisevich.onrender.com/api/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Camry",
  "year": 2022,
  "pricePerDay": 99,
  "isAvailable": false
}

### 4. Удалить авто (204 No Content)
DELETE https://wt-lab6-6minimalapi-borisevich.onrender.com/api/cars/2